 Rust) is **empty**; passes under `{default, --no-default-features, --all-features}` × `{dev, release}` (`scripts/check_all_features.sh`).\n\n## Two real problems found\n1. **Harness flaw (fixed):** `cargo test` never builds a `cdylib` artifact, so the suite was silently validating a **stale** `.so`. `rust_lib_path()` now rebuilds on demand and *asserts* the `.so` is not older than any source; the C `.so` is freshness-checked too.\n2. To prove the suite can fail, `scripts/mutation_check.py` injects 25 mutations: **23/23 behaviour-changing mutants killed**, 2 provably equivalent mutants correctly survived.\n\n## Result\n**No divergence found in the Rust translation** — every `CONFIGS.md` row and every `ERRORS.md` row matches the C in both return value and stdout, under all feature combinations and both profiles. Details in `VERIFICATION.md`. `c_src/` was not modified (only the `build/` directory was added)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":332,"cache_read_input_tokens":154730,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":332,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"299a4136-f7e5-4178-ae5a-8e0a5c02f6b7","uuid":"d87c719b-dea4-49b5-96b6-17a806337292","timestamp":"2026-08-27T23:22:26.257Z"}
